## Frequently Asked Questions

### Is JarveePro Nexus Free suitable for beginners?

Yes. The free edition is intended as a starting point for users who want to explore AI-assisted content workflows and social media management.

### How many social media accounts can I manage?

The stated free-edition allowance is up to 5 accounts per platform across the 10 core platforms. Check the current product information for any version-specific conditions.

### Which social media platforms are supported?

The guide covers Facebook, Instagram, X, YouTube, TikTok, LinkedIn, Pinterest, Reddit, Threads, and Telegram. Available actions may vary by platform.

### Can AI create content for different social media platforms?

AI can help draft, adapt, and organize content for different audiences and formats. Review the output before publishing to ensure it is accurate, relevant, and appropriate for each platform.

### Is social media management only about scheduling posts?

No. A useful workflow can also include content planning, audience research, content adaptation, distribution, and performance review. Scheduling is just one part of the process.

### Where can I find official product information?

Visit the [JarveePro official website](https://jarveepro.com/) for product information and updates.
